<b>Example 3:</b> The following code first queries a database for an employee with a given ID, converts the results into a list, and stores the list inside <code>employeesBean</code>.

<pre>
public class employeesBean {
   private List&lt;EmployeeData&gt; employeeList;
   ...
   public List&lt;EmployeeData&gt; getEmployeeList() {
      ...
